            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>QuietSpeech 0.3.7</h2>
<ul>
<li>Choose and remember a microphone in setup or Settings → Transcription. Reconnect a missing microphone or select another input before dictating.</li>
<li>Check your microphone with a live input meter and a 15-second test that saves no audio.</li>
<li>Automatically pause media while dictating and resume it after transcription finishes, when it was playing beforehand.</li>
<li>See a dot on the menu bar icon when an update is available, with Install New Update as the first menu option.</li>
<li>Fix the listening overlay intermittently disappearing when starting dictations in quick succession.</li>
<li>Improve shortcut recovery when macOS interrupts keyboard access, with a Restore Shortcuts option.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
